# Caddy reverse proxy — automatic HTTPS for PolicyInsight.
#
# Caddy obtains and auto-renews a free Let's Encrypt certificate for APP_DOMAIN
# and redirects HTTP→HTTPS. Requirements:
#   - APP_DOMAIN resolves (public DNS A/AAAA) to this server
#   - inbound TCP 80 and 443 reachable from the internet (ACME challenge)
#
# Bring-your-own certificate (corporate/internal CA, or no public domain):
#   mount your cert+key into the caddy service and replace the site block with:
#     {$APP_DOMAIN} {
#         tls /certs/fullchain.pem /certs/privkey.pem
#         reverse_proxy frontend:80
#     }
#   For a quick internal/test cert with no CA, use Caddy's local CA:
#     {$APP_DOMAIN} { tls internal
#         reverse_proxy frontend:80 }

{
	email {$ACME_EMAIL}
}

{$APP_DOMAIN} {
	encode gzip
	reverse_proxy frontend:80
}
